{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Archaeology Rush",
    "steam_appid": 3244320,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oct 1921 - Valley of the Kings - Four competing egyptologists stumble on a new discovery. A Pharaoh's tomb! However only one archaeologist can claim the find!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/f5e8f901813f39120958dc8eeee022d4.poster.avif?t=1730454324\" width=800 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/f5e8f901813f39120958dc8eeee022d4.webm?t=1730454324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/f5e8f901813f39120958dc8eeee022d4.mp4?t=1730454324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Tombs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a tomb full of puzzle chambers. Work together or against players to solve a variety of puzzles and open each chamber door. The first player to complete the chamber wins the discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Treasures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and collect treasures littered throughout the tomb\u2019s chambers. Each treasure collected adds to your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/6bb3bdaac0d4dadace0609ff1fbf5fca.poster.avif?t=1730454324\" width=800 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/6bb3bdaac0d4dadace0609ff1fbf5fca.webm?t=1730454324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/6bb3bdaac0d4dadace0609ff1fbf5fca.mp4?t=1730454324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exchange treasures at the mummy shop, or use them to purchase skills - higher jump, navigational aids, or more boost. Don't get too carried away though - the more you spend the less you can take back to your museum!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/879622fa4ee19fed1c2d3508bda9b73c.poster.avif?t=1730454324\" width=800 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/879622fa4ee19fed1c2d3508bda9b73c.webm?t=1730454324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/879622fa4ee19fed1c2d3508bda9b73c.mp4?t=1730454324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Win Alone or Co-Op</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or compete with friends to discover the secrets buried deep in the tomb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of treasures gained to compete between sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable &quot;Random Chambers&quot; to shuffle the tomb and play new chambers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oct 1921 - Valley of the Kings - Four competing egyptologists stumble on a new discovery. A Pharaoh's tomb! However only one archaeologist can claim the find!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/f5e8f901813f39120958dc8eeee022d4.poster.avif?t=1730454324\" width=800 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/f5e8f901813f39120958dc8eeee022d4.webm?t=1730454324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/f5e8f901813f39120958dc8eeee022d4.mp4?t=1730454324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover Tombs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a tomb full of puzzle chambers. Work together or against players to solve a variety of puzzles and open each chamber door. The first player to complete the chamber wins the discovery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Treasures</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and collect treasures littered throughout the tomb\u2019s chambers. Each treasure collected adds to your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/6bb3bdaac0d4dadace0609ff1fbf5fca.poster.avif?t=1730454324\" width=800 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/6bb3bdaac0d4dadace0609ff1fbf5fca.webm?t=1730454324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/6bb3bdaac0d4dadace0609ff1fbf5fca.mp4?t=1730454324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exchange treasures at the mummy shop, or use them to purchase skills - higher jump, navigational aids, or more boost. Don't get too carried away though - the more you spend the less you can take back to your museum!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/879622fa4ee19fed1c2d3508bda9b73c.poster.avif?t=1730454324\" width=800 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/879622fa4ee19fed1c2d3508bda9b73c.webm?t=1730454324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3244320/extras/879622fa4ee19fed1c2d3508bda9b73c.mp4?t=1730454324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Win Alone or Co-Op</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or compete with friends to discover the secrets buried deep in the tomb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of treasures gained to compete between sessions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enable &quot;Random Chambers&quot; to shuffle the tomb and play new chambers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Play alone or with friends, as up to four egyptologists. Stumble upon an undiscovered tomb, pillage artefacts for your collection and discover its secrets to become the most famous archaeologist! But take note - to win you might have to work together too.",
